  m_Name: Tema_ValeDasChamines
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::ThemedPhaseData
  _themeName: "Vale das Chamin\xE9s"
  _themeNameEn: Smokestack Valley
  _summary: "Polo industrial com caixa cheio e esgoto a c\xE9u aberto."
  _summaryEn: A factory town with a full treasury and open sewers.
  _opening: "As f\xE1bricas pagam as contas, mas o c\xF3rrego mudou de cor h\xE1
    tempos e o posto de sa\xFAde sabe o motivo. Voc\xEA tem 20 turnos para virar
    esse jogo sem fechar o port\xE3o de nenhuma f\xE1brica."
  _openingEn: The factories pay the bills, but the creek changed color long ago and
    the health clinic knows why. You have 20 turns to turn things around without
    shutting a single factory gate.
  _victory: "O c\xF3rrego ainda n\xE3o \xE9 cart\xE3o-postal, mas a cidade chegou
    ao fim dos 20 turnos de p\xE9."
  _victoryEn: The creek is no postcard yet, but the city made it through all 20 turns.
  _inspiration: "Cidade fict\xEDcia. No Brasil, cerca de 90 milh\xF5es de pessoas
    vivem sem coleta de esgoto (Trata Brasil, 2026)."
  _inspirationEn: Fictional city. In Brazil, about 90 million people live without
    sewage collection (Trata Brasil, 2026).
  _knowledgeEntry: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 73dcd6e4dcd9079f283b5ab9dc70d596, type: 2}
